message: "This is an untagged scientific-revision candidate; cite a released version when available."
title: "EXOTIC-CCR A001: Poisson/Weyl lifts and Lean-backed dual-transport deficiency theory"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fredriksen
    given-names: Daniel Eric
    affiliation: "Quantyra Inc"
